                "Better for relationship queries"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "In-Memory Databases",
            "content": [
                "Data stored in RAM",
                "Faster than disk databases",
                "Low latency",
                "Used in real-time systems"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "Features of In-Memory DB",
            "content": [
                "High-speed operations",
                "Real-time analytics",
                "Supports persistence",
                "Efficient indexing"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "In-Memory vs Disk Databases",
            "content": [
                "RAM vs disk storage",
                "Faster vs slower",
                "Higher cost vs lower cost",
                "Real-time vs long-term storage"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "Partitioning",
            "content": [
                "Divide large tables into parts",
                "Improves performance",
                "Enhances scalability",
                "Better manageability"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "Partitioning Strategies",
            "content": [
                "Range partitioning",
                "List partitioning",
                "Hash partitioning",
                "Composite partitioning"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "Horizontal vs Vertical Partitioning",
            "content": [
                "Horizontal: divide rows",
                "Vertical: divide columns",
                "Improves performance",
                "Used in large datasets"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "Sharding",
            "content": [
                "Horizontal partitioning across servers",
                "Distributes data across nodes",
                "Improves scalability",
                "Used in distributed systems"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "Shard Key",
            "content": [
                "Determines data distribution",
                "Should ensure balance",
                "Affects performance",
                "Critical design decision"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "Shard Management",
            "content": [
                "Monitors shard load",
                "Ensures data balance",
                "Handles scaling",
                "Maintains consistency"
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "Shard Rebalancing",
            "content": [
